# Keep the build context small and secrets out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
**/.env
**/.env.local
apps/api/var
apps/field/android
mockups
tools
tests/e2e/out
tests/e2e/.build
**/*.log
**/*:Zone.Identifier
# docs: only what the running app needs (design tokens, /brand/ page)
docs/*
!docs/design-system
!docs/brand
